Error is in "a-method" compares specific to a particular "key type".
Why to change a "generic" method?


Quote from EVP_PKEY_ASN1_METHOD(3):
```
The pub_cmp() method is called when two public keys are to be compared. It MUST return 1 when the keys are equal, 0 otherwise. It's called by EVP_PKEY_cmp(3) <https://www.openssl.org/docs/man1.1.1/man3/EVP_PKEY_cmp.html>.
```

Of course OpenSSL does not follow strictly documentation. Also It is long story misuse of comparison functions. EC key "cmp" is another sample in this particular case.


